"823319580","798500005"],"description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"This book examines the work of Abu Talib al-Makki and his wider significance within the Sufi tradition, with a focus on the role of the heart. Analysing his most significant work, Qut al-qulub ('The Nourishment of Hearts'), the author goes beyond an examination of the themes of the book to explore its influence not only in the writing of the Sufis, but also of Hanibali and Jewish scholars. Providing a comprehensive overview of the world of al-Makki and presenting extracts from his book on religious characteristics of the heart with selected passages in translation for the first ime in English, this book will give readers a better understanding not only of the essential features of Sufism, but also the nature of mysticism and its relation to monotheistic faiths. -- from the book."},"number_of_pages":196,"latest_revision":8,"revision":8,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2012-07-11T10:29:48.040016"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2024-09-07T03:39:39.605474"}}},"ISBN:9781135103927":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9781135103927","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL33677013M/Islamic_Mysticism_and_Abu_Talib_Al-Makki","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL33677013M/Islamic_Mysticism_and_Abu_Talib_Al-Makki","details":{"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL7150755A","name":"Saeko Yazaki"}],"isbn_13":["9781135103927"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"number_of_pages":216,"publish_date":"2012","publishers":["Taylor & Francis Group"],"source_records":["bwb:9781135103927"],"subjects":["Mysticism, islam"],"title":"Islamic Mysticism and Abu Talib Al-Makki","subtitle":"The Role of the Heart","full_title":"Islamic Mysticism and Abu Talib Al-Makki The Role of the Heart","works":[{"key":"/works/OL16700249W"}],"key":"/books/OL33677013M","latest_revision":1,"revision":1,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2021-09-20T17:49:05.474543"},"